  "item.agesandtheart.cramped_age_survey.age_name": "Reshan",
  "item.agesandtheart.cramped_age_survey.page.1": "Guild of Maintainers\nSurvey of %1$s, for the Council\n\nThe air is good and the water clean, and beneath the ground lie caverns enough for a nation. The Guild had hopes of it.",
  "item.agesandtheart.cramped_age_survey.page.2": "But its caverns are fissures. They climb out of sight above and below, and nowhere are they wider than a street. A town could not be built in them, let alone a city.",
  "item.agesandtheart.cramped_age_survey.page.3": "Finding: rejected.\n\nThe fissures of %1$s are large, and no use to us. Housing the whole population will need large chambers underground: vaults so wide that a city could stand on an island in their lake.",
  "item.agesandtheart.cured_ink_cake": "Cured Ink Cake",
  "item.agesandtheart.descriptive_book": "Descriptive Book",
