  "item.agesandtheart.fine_ink_bucket": "Bucket of Fine Ink",
  "item.agesandtheart.fine_paper": "Fine Paper",
  "item.agesandtheart.hadalfish_lure": "Hadalfish Lure",
  "item.agesandtheart.ink_bottle": "Ink Bottle",
  "item.agesandtheart.ink_bucket": "Bucket of Ink",
  "item.agesandtheart.ink_cake": "Ink Cake",
  "item.agesandtheart.lightless_age_survey": "Survey of Gomur",
  "item.agesandtheart.lightless_age_survey.age_name": "Gomur",
  "item.agesandtheart.lightless_age_survey.page.1": "Guild of Maintainers\nSurvey of %1$s, for the Council\n\nThe land is gentle, the lakes are wide and the rock is sound. But no sun rises over %1$s.",
  "item.agesandtheart.lightless_age_survey.page.2": "Without a sun there is no day. Within a month the party slept when it liked and woke when it liked, and quarrelled. The lamps kept us from falling. They did not keep us together.",
  "item.agesandtheart.lightless_age_survey.page.3": "At home the cavern keeps its hours by the algae in its lake, which brightens and dims as a day would. The lakes of %1$s hold nothing of the kind.",
  "item.agesandtheart.lightless_age_survey.page.4": "Finding: rejected.\n\nA home must be written with the algae in it, and a lake for the algae to grow in. Light enough to see by is not a day.",
