  "item.agesandtheart.sunlit_age_survey.age_name": "Taleen",
  "item.agesandtheart.sunlit_age_survey.page.1": "Guild of Maintainers\nSurvey of %1$s, for the Council\n\nForty days on the ground. The air is sweet, the water clean, the soil the richest this Guild has walked. The party met nothing dangerous.",
  "item.agesandtheart.sunlit_age_survey.page.2": "The Age lies open to its sky, and the sun is fierce. By the tenth day nobody in the party could work past midday. By the twentieth, two were sick with it.\n\nOur people have lived under stone too long to live under a sun again.",
  "item.agesandtheart.sunlit_age_survey.page.3": "Finding: rejected.\n\nOnly an Age closed overhead can be endured. However fair its sky may look, our people cannot live under one.",
